{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Read First: Who Is This Game For?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who love <i>Hades</i>, <i>The Binding of Isaac</i>, <i>Hollow Knight</i>, or <i>Dark Souls</i> \u2014 but wish the controls weren\u2019t so punishing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy <strong>fast-paced combat</strong>, <strong>strategic thinking</strong>, and <strong>relaxing gameplay</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who proudly <strong>serve the Demon Lord</strong>. \ud83d\ude08</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CardVenture: Just A Head</strong> is a 2D cartoon-style <strong>action roguelike</strong> that blends <strong>real-time action</strong> with <strong>turn-based combat</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the <strong>decapitated head of the Demon Lord</strong>, setting out on a journey to reclaim your throne. <br>Battle, build, and choose wisely as you rally your lost followers, challenge the usurping Black Dragon Queen, and uncover the truth behind your own sealing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game requires <strong>zero reaction speed</strong>, yet delivers <strong>satisfying, fast-paced combat</strong> with deep strategy, dark humor, and a uniquely whimsical tone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Turn-Based Action Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies only act after you move \u2014 no twitch reflexes required! <br>Experience the <i>soulslike</i> thrill of dodging and countering, but with clear, controllable pacing. <br>You can take it slow\u2026 or go all-in with stylish parries and dodges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/3c3808302c91bbef58735a0d952d418a.poster.avif?t=1763799545\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/3c3808302c91bbef58735a0d952d418a.webm?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/3c3808302c91bbef58735a0d952d418a.mp4?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Build System with Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of weapons \u00d7 hundreds of ability cards = <br>a brand-new <strong>Build</strong> every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/4d3c7ef6d0a54b61075451cd1d0305af.poster.avif?t=1763799545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/4d3c7ef6d0a54b61075451cd1d0305af.webm?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/4d3c7ef6d0a54b61075451cd1d0305af.mp4?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf A World Made of Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated maps filled with secrets, events, and hidden rooms. <br>Everything in the world \u2014 environments, enemies, NPCs, chests \u2014 is a <strong>card</strong> you can <strong>interact with or destroy</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/1022815326bb17f786b5a29bdfa8eb07.poster.avif?t=1763799545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/1022815326bb17f786b5a29bdfa8eb07.webm?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/1022815326bb17f786b5a29bdfa8eb07.mp4?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc09 Creative Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has its own distinct behavior \u2014 <br>whether it\u2019s <i>Tetris</i>, <i>card-drawing</i>, <i>chess moves</i>, or <i>cloning</i>\u2026 <br>observe, adapt, and overcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/9535102e199641f0f67c70a000a3d9b8.poster.avif?t=1763799545\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/9535102e199641f0f67c70a000a3d9b8.webm?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/9535102e199641f0f67c70a000a3d9b8.mp4?t=1763799545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Hand-Drawn Cute Cartoon Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing flat art style mixed with <strong>dark humor</strong> and <strong>fantasy charm</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Demo Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude0a Experience the <strong>first two full chapters</strong>, including all core gameplay features. <br>\ud83e\udd2c <strong>5 unique weapons</strong>: Eye Laser Cannon, Skull Gauntlet, Thunder Chidori, Hero\u2019s Greatsword, Divine Crossbow. <br>\ud83d\ude08 <strong>4 main ability archetypes</strong>: Bombs, Lightning, Bats, Summons. <br>\ud83d\ude1f <strong>1</strong> <strong>basic out-of-battle upgrade system</strong> for persistent progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udfa8 About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YuWave</strong> is a solo indie developer from China \u2014 yes, the <strong>art, programming, design, and marketing</strong> are all done by one person. \ud83d\ude08 <br>He loves playing (and making) all kinds of games. <br>Recent favorites include <i>Outer Wilds</i>, <i>Hollow Knight</i>, and <i>Songs of Conquest</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude0a Lastly, From the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the name of the Demon Lord\u2026 <br>why haven\u2019t you <strong>added it to your wishlist</strong> yet?! \ud83e\udd2c</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720420?t=1763799545","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720420?t=1763799545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/4c00dcf45d5d1d2a6de4daceccc7c61060c259a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763799545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/4c00dcf45d5d1d2a6de4daceccc7c61060c259a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763799545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3788810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Read Firs